   "source": [
    "# Lecture 5 — Class Exercise\n",
    "## Distribution Charts: Airbnb London\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Push to:** `week05/lecture05_exercise.ipynb`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Rules:**\n",
    "1. Cap price outliers at 95th percentile — annotate this\n",
    "2. Every chart has a **median/mean reference line** with annotation\n",
    "3. Insight title names the distribution shape or key finding\n",
    "4. Colour has meaning — don't use colour just for decoration\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "c48a8799-2663-43e2-b467-0537b50d3a55",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "All libraries loaded successfully!\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
